BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:kefalonia-lakithra-livathos-panigiri-of-agia-anna-lakithra-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270724
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270726
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agia Anna\, Lakithra
LOCATION:Lakithra (Livathos)\, Kefalonia\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Lakithra\, the Livathos village where Byron stayed\, celebrates Agia Anna with vespers and a panigiri in the square on the evening of 24 July\, with a live orchestra and food and wine from the village association. It opens the busiest fortnight of Livathos panigiria: Faraklata has Agia Paraskevi on the 25th and Fragata a Kefalonian glendi on the 26th.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kefalonia/#lakithra-livathos-panigiri-of-agia-anna-lakithra
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kefalonia/#lakithra-livathos-panigiri-of-agia-anna-lakithra
END:VEVENT
