DESCRIPTION:Faraklata\, on the hill road between Argostoli and Sami\, throws its panigiri for Agia Paraskevi on the eve\, 25 July: vespers\, then an orchestra in the square\, grilled meat\, pies and wine until late. Ten minutes from Argostoli\, popular with the town crowd\, so the square fills by 10pm.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kefalonia/#faraklata-panigiri-of-agia-paraskevi-faraklata
