BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:kefalonia-simotata-livathos-panigiri-of-the-dormition-simotata-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270814
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270816
SUMMARY:Panigiri of the Dormition\, Simotata
LOCATION:Simotata (Livathos)\, Kefalonia\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The Livathos village of Simotata keeps 15 August the traditional way: vespers\, then from 8pm on the 14th a village panigiri in the square with live music\, food from the cultural association and dancing. Ten minutes from the airport and the Lassi hotels\, so easy to reach\; the same night Agkonas in Thinia has a panigiri with the Pavlatos orchestra if you prefer the west.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kefalonia/#simotata-livathos-panigiri-of-the-dormition-simotata
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kefalonia/#simotata-livathos-panigiri-of-the-dormition-simotata
END:VEVENT
