UID:kefalonia-omala-agios-gerasimos-monastery-feast-of-agios-gerasimos-oma-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270815
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270817
SUMMARY:Feast of Agios Gerasimos\, Omala monastery
LOCATION:Omala (Agios Gerasimos monastery)\, Kefalonia\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Patron saint of Kefalonia. Major pilgrimage to the monastery in Omala valley\; the saint's relics are paraded. The 16/8 procession is the larger of the two annual events.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kefalonia/#omala-agios-gerasimos-monastery-feast-of-agios-gerasimos-oma
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kefalonia/#omala-agios-gerasimos-monastery-feast-of-agios-gerasimos-oma
END:VEVENT
