BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:kefalonia-komitata-panigiri-of-komitata-erisos-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270815
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270817
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Komitata\, Erisos
LOCATION:Komitata\, Kefalonia\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The northern village of Komitata\, on the Erisos peninsula between Agia Efimia and Fiskardo\, holds a two-day panigiri on 15–16 August run by the village cultural association: church in the morning\, then long tables\, grilled meat\, wine and a live orchestra in the square both nights. Pyrgi on the Sami side has its own on the 16th and Antipata/Pylaros on the 14th if you are touring.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kefalonia/#komitata-panigiri-of-komitata-erisos
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kefalonia/#komitata-panigiri-of-komitata-erisos
END:VEVENT
